# Debian Trixie has no fixed-version metadata for these CVEs, but this image
# installs the fixed Debian Sid packages at exact versions pinned in Dockerfile:
# ncurses-bin 6.6+20260608-2, openssl-provider-legacy 3.6.5-1,
# libsqlite3-0 3.54.1-2, libudev1 262.2-1, libacl1 2.4.0-1,
# util-linux 2.42.4-1, and perl-base 5.44.0-3.
# Trivy maps the image to Debian 13/Trixie and reports these as affected even
# when the installed package comes from the fixed Sid release. Keep in sync
# with the version-pinned apt install in Dockerfile.
